  m_Name: Object_114
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Cylinder Head Cover Plate
  description: The Cylinder Head Cover Plate is a tiny, thin-flat plate positioned
    at the top-center-center of the engine, covering and protecting the cylinder
    head. Its primary function is to prevent debris and moisture from entering the
    cylinder head, maintaining a clean engine environment and ensuring proper valve
    operation. Notably, the plate's material, Material.001, is chosen for its high
    strength-to-weight ratio, allowing it to withstand extreme temperatures and pressures
    while minimizing weight and maximizing engine efficiency.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
